Z||000000||Springtyme||09-12-2001||09:23 AM||||Could anyone give me some information on the Pontiac show in Reading, PA? I think it's on the 23rd... any other info is greatly appreciated. I'd love to come! But I need to know where it is  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bounce.gif">  Hehehe<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg"> <P>            ~Springtyme~||||reg||5
Z||000001||Fierochic88||09-12-2001||03:07 PM||||Hi there,<BR>   Unfortunately I will be unable to attend (will be in PSU that weekend) but my parents will be there as well as many other MAFOA and Forum members.  The show is located at A.W. Golden Pontiac located on Route 222 South Business/Lancaster Avenue in Shillington, PA.  The best way to get there from Hellertown would probably be to hop onto 222 right there in Trexlertown.  Take it past Kutztown until you see signs for Route 222 Business/Reading/Fifth St.  Get on here and go down 5th Street till you see signs for Route 12 West.  Take Route 12 West to Route 422 East/222 South (this will help avoid the city traffic).  Then after getting on 422 East you will see a left exit for Route 222 South.  At the bottom of the 222 Ramp, turn Right.  Go past Golden Cheverolet, go under the bridge and Golden Pontiac is on your right.  Hope you have fun!<P>Jennifer<P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
