Z||000020||grgoyl86||09-17-2001||07:58 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Spiff:<P>Bob, Count me in. I may even bring my brother,if I can wake him up. Just give me a time to meet you at the Galleria.[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Let's say about 7:30, at the Rutter's store on Mt. Zion Road near the Galleria Mall. I'll be in my red GT.<P>From there we'll go to the Sheetz store off the Brownstown exit of 222 to meet up with Denny, should be about 8:15. Then on to Silk City Diner. We should get there about 8:30.<P>Anyone else wanna join us at either location, let Denny or I know.<P>See ya there.<P><P>------------------<BR><B>Bob Schlag</B><BR><I>Mid Atlantic Fiero Owners Association</I><BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ani_interior.gif"> ||||reg||12
