Z||000022||grgoyl86||09-17-2001||07:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by skitime:<BR><B>We will be at the Silk City Diner for breakfast but I think we should be there earlier than 8:30.  I would think 8:00 at the latest.  Registration opens at 9:00 and it will be at least a half hour drive from the diner.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah, but you don't have an hour's drive to get there!   8^)<P>We usually get there about 9:30 - 10:00, after the 9:00 rush is over.<BR><P>------------------<BR><B>Bob Schlag</B><BR><I>Mid Atlantic Fiero Owners Association</I><BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ani_interior.gif"> ||||reg||1
